                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Def:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>The rate calculated by dividing the number of Pelican orders in which the picker clicks on &apos;Replace Items&apos; (indicating initiation for replacement) by the total number of Pelican orders placed.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
