                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>Def: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>The number of Pelican orders/items within the replacement flow where the picker clicked on the scanner button to open the scanner for item scanning</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
